  "description": "A recorded General MIDI instrument library for CodeBrix.Audio. The package carries the FluidR3_GM SoundFont and registers it under the name \"FluidR3Gm\", so an application that already plays MIDI swaps its entire sound for recorded instruments in one line. Every General MIDI program and the percussion kit are covered, one SoundFont is shared by every part of an arrangement, and the file is loaded lazily on first use.",
